    "proposed_only": "Independently warm R and T and reach all-fresh in the same released-Ohm private store. Apply complete reverse of 609e184 once (stdlib builtins and real Ruff diagnostic fixture). Two independent clones compare order R then T and T then R, with immediate repeated and restored controls. Require actual current ruff_python_stdlib --out-dir, argv, all externs, rustc/driver and --emit to match; bind .rlib, .rmeta, codegen objects, active compiler flags, source and serialized dep-info before and after switching. Use both complete native terminal traces; separately run each CLI and compare to fresh same-mode referents. Ruff py315 print(__cached__) F821 is the independent edit behavior; py314 is its negative. For a true redundant opportunity require a second full compiler with identical relevant physical inputs and exact output, or same native-link inputs/outputs and negative file observations including scripts. Different hashes, absent units, correctly fresh, or a linker observed path+ordering difference ends the respective claim."
